while experiencing a powerful original Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles story from acclaimed indie studio Strange Scaffold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229100/extras/8adf99ed01695e4a0fb1cf5229ebf368.poster.avif?t=1771949136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229100/extras/8adf99ed01695e4a0fb1cf5229ebf368.webm?t=1771949136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229100/extras/8adf99ed01695e4a0fb1cf5229ebf368.mp4?t=1771949136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the next step for Michelangelo, Donatello, Leonardo, and Raphael--and you can experience it with flying, slashing figurines in graphic novel-inspired splendor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 action-packed levels, divided into campaigns focusing on individual characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique take on the world of Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles from the minds at Strange Scaffold (Space Warlord Organ Trading Simulator, I Am Your Beast).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative turn-based beat-em-up combat, complete with mutating arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous graphic novel-inspired art style, with paint splatter, figurines, and diorama setpieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable movesets to shape each Turtles' playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thumping multi-genre soundtrack from award-winning composer RJ Lake (Unbeatable, I Am Your Beast).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut